                                "example_id": "6d8e2d61-a497-45e9-8984-af6a82e8a9ca",
                                "sense_id": "712279a4-6a31-3b83-a196-0d44a53669b1",
                                "text": "This done, he reimportuned Victor Riley, who, knowing now what Fred had known for weeks about the T.T. engine inventory, had one of the spares gift wrapped and released to the gruff little Yorkshireman."
